.TH "MAKE:APP" 1 "September 2026" "SPP Framework" "SPP Commands Manual"
.SH NAME
make:app \- Scaffold a new isolated SPP application context
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B php spp.php make:app
[\fIapp_name\fR] [\fIapp_type\fR] [\fIbase_url\fR] [\fItable_prefix\fR] [\fB\-\-enterprise\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B make:app
command initializes an isolated application namespace under \fIsrc/<AppName>/\fR, \fIetc/apps/<AppName>/\fR, and \fIresources/<AppName>/\fR.
.PP
Available application architecture types include:
.TP
.B barebones
Minimal clean starter with step-by-step developer directions & guidance on visual page design, entities, workflows, partials, and testing. Recommended for novice developers.
.TP
.B mixed
Flagship showcase combining SPP-UX reactive components, Blade views, PHP scripts, and REST API.
.TP
.B blade
Server-rendered application using Blade templates and ViewControllers.
.TP
.B sppux
Single Page Application (SPA) driven by SPP-UX reactive component stores.
.TP
.B native
Native PHP pages augmented with ViewPage pipeline.
.TP
.B api
Headless REST API backend with JSON endpoints and authentication middleware.
.TP
.B dropin
Low-code prototyping structure with drop-in HTML/PHP files.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fIapp_name\fR
PascalCase application name (e.g., MyClinic).
.TP
\fIapp_type\fR
Application architecture preset: \fIbarebones\fR (default), \fImixed\fR, \fIblade\fR, \fIsppux\fR, \fInative\fR, \fIapi\fR, or \fIdropin\fR.
.TP
\fIbase_url\fR
Routing path segment (default: /<app_name>).
.TP
\fItable_prefix\fR
Database table prefix for entity isolation (default: <app_name>_).
.TP
\fB\-\-enterprise\fR
Enable enterprise Redis caching and session handling.
.SH UNDER THE HOOD
.IP 1. 4
Creates application directories, workflow configurations (\fIetc/apps/<AppName>/workflows/default.yml\fR), and registers routes in \fIspp/etc/global-settings.yml\fR.
.IP 2. 4
Generates starter Blade views, layouts, and controllers.
.IP 3. 4
Runs initial database migrations via \fBphp spp.php migrate \-\-app=<AppName>\fR if the \fIsppdb\fR module is active.
.IP 4. 4
Synchronizes directory manifests (\fI__spp_file_props.yml\fR).
.IP 5. 4
Guarded by CLI SAPI check (\fBisCLIOnly() === true\fR).
